<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51379" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰτᾰλ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Italian,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				659b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵρεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					1.3.9
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπεῖρα,</span>
			=
			<i>Cohors Italica,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Act.Ap.
				10.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰταλικοί, οἱ,</span>
			<u>Italians</u> resident at Delos, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				726.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, etc.:—pecul. fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰτᾰλ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.373
			</span></i> (Thall.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ἰταλίς</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>), 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰταλία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				54.22
			</span></i> codd. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰτᾰλ-ιώτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <i>Greek inhabitant of Italy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.44
			</span></i>, etc.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σικελιώτης</span>:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰτᾰλ-ιῶτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, Adj.<i>Italian,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆες, πόλεις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.4.4
			</span></i>: Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰτᾰλ-ιωτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				326b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist. Conscr.</u>
				15
			</span></i>.</div>
